  "objective_summary": "Extended ResourceScheduler with leased multidimensional hard reservations without replacing existing host/provider admission, ResourceAdmissionLease, adaptive stage capacity, or schedule/evaluate contracts. New fabric types cover CPU concurrency/time, RAM, GPU memory/compute class, disk capacity/bandwidth, network permission/bandwidth, subprocesses, worktrees, model input/output tokens, provider concurrency/quota, prover class/concurrency, license/key exclusivity, merge slots, and persistence bandwidth. Reservations bind task/attempt/supervisor/daemon/lease/fence identities, never overcommit GPU memory, provider/prover concurrency, merge authority, exclusive writers, worktree mutation, or license keys, and reclaim on completion, cancellation, timeout, confirmed death, or fenced expiry with a later fencing token. Worker completion or task status alone never authorizes acceptance.",
